## Project Overview
Designed and simulated a Hotel Management Network using Cisco Packet Tracer.

## Network Segmentation
- VLAN 10 – Reception
- VLAN 20 – Accounts
- VLAN 30 – Administration
- VLAN 40 – Restaurant
- VLAN 50 – Guest Wi-Fi
- VLAN 60 – Security
- VLAN 70 – Servers
- VLAN 99 – Management

## Technologies Used
- VLAN and Inter-VLAN Routing
- Layer 3 Switching
- DHCP and DHCP Relay
- DNS
- Extended ACL
- Guest Network Security

## Security Implementation
Configured Extended ACLs to restrict Guest VLAN access to internal department networks while allowing required DNS and DHCP services.

## Tool
Cisco Packet Tracer

## Project File
Hotel Management Network Packet Tracer simulation .(pkt)
